      "id": "the-black-swan-ref-1",
      "chapterOrder": 1,
      "title": "Auditing Turkey Exposure",
      "prompt": "Identify the single area in your professional or operational portfolio where past stability is most dangerously confused with future safety. If 1,000 days of uninterrupted success have conditioned your team to lower defenses, what sudden structural shock would render that track record completely irrelevant?",
